Your own Cyberdeck firewall rules: *.nft files in this directory.

Example — open ssh (file ssh.nft):

    add rule inet cyberdeck allow tcp dport 22 accept

Only from your home network:

    add rule inet cyberdeck allow ip saddr 192.168.1.0/24 tcp dport 22 accept

Apply:      sudo nft -c -f /etc/nftables.conf && sudo systemctl reload nftables
Inspect:    sudo nft list table inet cyberdeck
Dropped packets: journalctl -k -g cyberdeck-fw
